					<tr>
						<td class="leftCell" align="left" valign="top" >
						<p style="line-height: 150%"><b>
						Overview</b></td>
						<td align="left" valign="top"  class="rightCell" >
<div class="myHeading"><b>Overview</b></div>

<p align="justify" style="line-height: 150%">
In 2020 I <span style="text-decoration: none">
<font color="#111111">retired</font></span> as a professor of
linguistics. My primary areas of interest are corpus linguistics,
language change and genre-based variation, the design and optimization of
linguistic databases, and frequency analyses (all for English, Spanish,
and Portuguese).
Please feel free to <a href="vita.asp">take a look at my
						CV</a>, a list of my <a href="publications.asp">
publications</a> (all downloadable), or my
						<a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=8-LRgUIAAAAJ&hl=en&oi=ao">
						Google Scholar</a> profile.
						<p style="line-height: 150%" align="justify">
But perhaps the best thing would be to simply try out some of the corpora that
I've
created (<a href="http://www.english-corpora.org/">English</a>,
<a href="https://www.corpusdelespanol.org/">Spanish</a>,
<a href="https://www.corpusdoportugues.org/">Portuguese</a>) -- to which I continue
to add new features. These corpora are the
<a href="http://www.english-corpora.org/users.asp">most widely
used corpora</a> in existence, and the
<a target="_top" href="https://www.english-corpora.org/help/architecture.pdf">
corpus architecture and interface</a> (which I designed myself) offer many
advantages compared to other large online corpora, in terms of <a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/speed.asp">speed</a>,
<a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/queries.asp">search types</a>,
<a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/help/association-measures.pdf">
collocates</a> and
<a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/help/topics-and-collocates.pdf">related
topics</a>, <a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/help/analyze-text.pdf">
analyzing entire texts</a>,
<a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/help/word-sketch.pdf">word sketches</a>,
<a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/help/virtual-corpora.pdf">Virtual
Corpora</a>, <a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/language-learning.asp">
language learning and teaching</a>, the ability to
<a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/variation.asp">analyze variation</a>
(historical, dialectal, and genre-based), the recent<b> </b>(2025)<b>
<a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/ai-llms/">integration of AI</a> </b>, and
<a href="https://www.english-corpora.org/pdf/english-corpora.pdf">much more</a>. 
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</div>
			</td>
